            <ArticleTitle>Home-based intravenous therapy for oncology patients.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>43-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>It is desirable to keep cancer patients at home whenever possible to maximize their physical comfort and mental well-being. However, physicians should be aware of all the serious limitations in terms of patient selection and avoidance of the abuses of overutilization of the system.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
